{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/Header_1_English.png?t=1746237409\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/Create.gif?t=1746237409\" /><strong><i>From Workshop to Empire! Manage your workshop as a master artisan, design unique products, and mesmerize your customers. Showcase your art by working with various materials from wood to fabric, metal to precious stones. Perfect your production processes to deliver orders on time, optimize your inventory management, and transform your business into a brand. Let each drawer, each shelf, each piece of furniture bear your signature. Prove yourself on the journey to becoming both a talented craftsman and a successful entrepreneur!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/Header_2_English.png?t=1746237409\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/Custom_Shop.gif?t=1746237409\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Shape your business as you want it! Place furniture, tear down walls, and create a unique environment that attracts customers while multiplying your production power. Every decoration choice directly affects both visual appeal and production capacity. Start with a small shop and transform it into a massive factory empire in later updates. The key to success lies in your creativity!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/Header_3_English.png?t=1746237409\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/ClothesShow.gif?t=1746237409\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Create Style with Unlimited Combination Options! Equip your workshop with 250,000+ unique clothing combinations and take customer satisfaction to the peak! Create collections that appeal to every taste and style with fabric varieties in different textures and patterns. Turn your hesitant customers into loyal ones by offering unlimited choices and start multiplying your sales!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/Header_4_English.png?t=1746237409\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/City.gif?t=1746237409\" />\u00a0 \u00a0 <i><strong>Step into Emporium District, the most profitable and vibrant business area of the city! Run your Tailor Shop exploring and interacting with Jazz Bar, Restaurant, Casino, Night Club, Technocomp, OE Broker, Wholesale and Coffee Shop. Enjoy Emporium District and grow your textile empire!</strong></i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3484750?t=1746237409","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/5ae73ea9415324b63d7e03f2b2e5811614b9af46/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746237409","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/5da07e07d17b32357fc388c0086f1633f4b942d0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746237409","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/5da07e07d17b32357fc388c0086f1633f4b942d0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746237409","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/Header_1_English.png?t=1746237409\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/Create.gif?t=1746237409\" /><strong><i>From Workshop to Empire! Manage your workshop as a master artisan, design unique products, and mesmerize your customers. Showcase your art by working with various materials from wood to fabric, metal to precious stones. Perfect your production processes to deliver orders on time, optimize your inventory management, and transform your business into a brand. Let each drawer, each shelf, each piece of furniture bear your signature. Prove yourself on the journey to becoming both a talented craftsman and a successful entrepreneur!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/Header_2_English.png?t=1746237409\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/Custom_Shop.gif?t=1746237409\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Shape your business as you want it! Place furniture, tear down walls, and create a unique environment that attracts customers while multiplying your production power. Every decoration choice directly affects both visual appeal and production capacity. Start with a small shop and transform it into a massive factory empire in later updates. The key to success lies in your creativity!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/Header_3_English.png?t=1746237409\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/ClothesShow.gif?t=1746237409\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Create Style with Unlimited Combination Options! Equip your workshop with 250,000+ unique clothing combinations and take customer satisfaction to the peak! Create collections that appeal to every taste and style with fabric varieties in different textures and patterns. Turn your hesitant customers into loyal ones by offering unlimited choices and start multiplying your sales!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/Header_4_English.png?t=1746237409\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/City.gif?t=1746237409\" />\u00a0 \u00a0 <i><strong>Step into Emporium District, the most profitable and vibrant business area of the city! Run your Tailor Shop exploring and interacting with Jazz Bar, Restaurant, Casino, Night Club, Technocomp, OE Broker, Wholesale and Coffee Shop. Enjoy Emporium District and grow your textile empire!</strong></i></p>","developers":["Zoady"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/f1416fd43791e5e2be4e901f7fe26a2b01b4e58a/header.jpg?t=1746237409","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257128934,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128934/movie480.mp4?t=1745972358","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128934/movie_max.mp4?t=1745972358"},"name":"Tailor Simulator | Preview Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257128934/51e2e01c8758284b75337430ff055a8adf3a33d1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745972358","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128934/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745972358","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128934/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=174